let readPage:Function(TokenPage,Int):Lexeme=function(page:TokenPage,lane:Int):Lexeme{branch when{
lane==0=>Lexeme{kind:page->kind0,text:page->text0,start:page->start0,end:page->end0,line:page->line0,column:page->column0,scalarStart:page->scalarStart0,scalarEnd:page->scalarEnd0,endLine:page->endLine0,endColumn:page->endColumn0},
lane==1=>Lexeme{kind:page->kind1,text:page->text1,start:page->start1,end:page->end1,line:page->line1,column:page->column1,scalarStart:page->scalarStart1,scalarEnd:page->scalarEnd1,endLine:page->endLine1,endColumn:page->endColumn1},
lane==2=>Lexeme{kind:page->kind2,text:page->text2,start:page->start2,end:page->end2,line:page->line2,column:page->column2,scalarStart:page->scalarStart2,scalarEnd:page->scalarEnd2,endLine:page->endLine2,endColumn:page->endColumn2},
